           "time": "+0m",
           "text": "**The declaration is fixed.** Each panel is declared once: its `type`, `title`, fixed fields such as the gauge's `max` and `unit`, and an optional `initial` starting state. Every panel on this page starts from its own `initial`.",
           "panels": {
