           "text": "**A few panel types already accept declaration-shaped state.** The radar declares `threshold: 80`; this step writes `threshold: 50` and the arc moves. Each such key is built into its own panel type: data-contract `columns` and `fields`, screen and security `scene`, zoneframe `zones`, timeline `events`, strandscene `actors`, cellscene `items`. Every other declaration field cannot change.",
