     {
      "label": "Panel types",
      "sections": [
       {
        "id": "catalog",
        "heading": "Where each of the 40 panel types sits today",
        "accent": "slate",
        "text": [
         "Read from the registered panel definitions on `main` (5744ca77)."
        ],
        "bullets": [
         {
          "text": "**Common fold** (shallow merge, `log` appends, `enterOnce`): state, leds, gauge, log, image, waterfall, orbit, zoneframe, xray, queue, thermo, buffer, radar, signal, tiles, table, data-contract, checks, budget, cost, trace, replicas."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Custom fold**, each with its own rules: screen, battery, homemap, inflight, phone, deviceapp, appscreens, timeline, sequence, reads, frames, locus, funnel, grid, strandscene, cellscene, seatmap, chime, dispatch, security."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Key-by-key merge maps**: funnel `counts`; grid `cells` and `marks`; seatmap `sold`, `held`, `price`, `tierOf`."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Append fields** beyond `log`: timeline `events` and `miss`."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Step-local events with carried results**: strandscene and cellscene `events`."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Derived from story time**: battery (drain and charge), phone, deviceapp and appscreens (clock and date)."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Declaration-shaped state keys** (a step replaces or re-tunes a declared value): data-contract `columns`, `fields`, `fieldWidth`; screen and security `scene`; zoneframe `zones`; radar `threshold`; timeline `events`; strandscene `actors`; cellscene `items`. Each is implemented inside its own panel."
         },
         {
          "text": "**Never changeable per step**: every other declaration field, for every type (for example gauge `max` and `unit`, funnel `stages`, table `columns`, the card `title`)."
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
